    {"type":"text","id":"a_l5","x":84,"y":694,"width":410,"height":34,"text":"Close · re-measure coverage, evidence set,\none consolidated status to ASPSI","originalText":"Close · re-measure coverage, evidence set,\none consolidated status to ASPSI","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":200029,"version":1,"versionNonce":200030,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"a_verdict","x":40,"y":750,"width":460,"height":110,"text":"+ first value ships on day 1 (F1); F3's long pole\n  never blocks the others\n+ one build/deploy per instrument — the Aug-17\n  migration rhythm\n+ each wave is its own reopen-able unit for testers\n− four patch notes instead of one\n− F3 testers wait longest (it is the biggest change)","originalText":"+ first value ships on day 1 (F1); F3's long pole\n  never blocks the others\n+ one build/deploy per instrument — the Aug-17\n  migration rhythm\n+ each wave is its own reopen-able unit for testers\n− four patch notes instead of one\n− F3 testers wait longest (it is the biggest change)","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":200031,"version":1,"versionNonce":200032,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

