    {"type":"text","id":"footer","x":40,"y":896,"width":1480,"height":40,"text":"Common to all three: the extractor anchors on the BUILD's English, so an item's English must match the Aug-21 paper before that item's translation can land — which is why C leaks on exactly the items DOH changed.\nVersions: F1 4.1.0 · F2 spec m4 · F4 3.2.0 · F3 6.1.0 (labels only; 97.x/115.x already exist — corrected 25 Aug evening). PSA set stays frozen at capi-psa-2026-08-20; everything here is the DEV channel.","originalText":"Common to all three: the extractor anchors on the BUILD's English, so an item's English must match the Aug-21 paper before that item's translation can land — which is why C leaks on exactly the items DOH changed.\nVersions: F1 4.1.0 · F2 spec m4 · F4 3.2.0 · F3 6.1.0 (labels only; 97.x/115.x already exist — corrected 25 Aug evening). PSA set stays frozen at capi-psa-2026-08-20; everything here is the DEV channel.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500003,"version":1,"versionNonce":500004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
